==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Originated 1925–30 from ''[[sense]]'' + ''[[-or]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈsɛn.sə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈsɛn.sɚ/|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|censer|censor}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[device]] or [[organ]] that detects certain [[external]] [[stimuli]] and responds in a distinctive manner.

